{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Family-born</b> — one born according to the law of the house of Israel, after betrothal and kiddushin." "<b>Outside-born</b> — outside the custom. And some say that the meaning of מולדת is like יולדו על ברכי יוסף (they were born on Joseph's knees), who grew up with you in the house, or she is in another place and another land and grew up outside the father's house with you. And afterward he mentioned your granddaughter."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:38.975276666Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}